<title>JAPAN: Bandai ask only after business forecast revision.</title>
<headline>Bandai ask only after business forecast revision.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bandai Co Ltd shares were ask-only in Thursday morning trade after it revised down its group business forecast before Wednesday's holiday, brokers said.</p>
<p>As of 0051 GMT the shares were ask only at 2,780 yen. They closed at 2,860 yen on Tuesday.  </p>
<p>On Tuesday, the leading toy manufacturer said it forecast a net loss of 9.00 billion yen in the year to March 31, 1997. This compares to an earlier forecast predicting a 10.50 billion yen profit.</p>
